{"id": "60851", "title": "墙倒处处爬", "author": "与子", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 8, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/60/60851.htm", "intro": "攘皓腕於神浒兮，采湍濑之玄芝：眷眷，我在河滩上伸出手，采撷你水流边的黑色芝草。\r\n\r\n抗琼珶以和予兮，指潜渊而为期：眷眷你举著琼玉向我作出回答，并指著深深的水流-晕诖-\r\n\r\n果真，很黄很暴力。流氓不可怕，就怕流氓有文化。\r\n\r\n孟北沚，曾经深深地诠释了这句话。\r\n\r\n那天，微风和煦，天气晴。\r\n\r\n孟北沚：孟眷眷，你是我的逆鳞。", "base": "files/article/html/60/60851", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "8941998.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "8941999.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "8942001.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "8942003.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "8942006.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "8942008.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "8942010.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-46", "file": "8942013.html", "available": false}]}